# 🎵 Godot 4 Dynamic Audio Engine & Sound Pool Architecture

This skill provides an enterprise audio foundation for Godot 4.x, featuring **Dynamic BGM Crossfading**, **Sound Effect Pooling**, and **Audio Ducking**.

---

## 🎚️ 1. Audio Bus Hierarchy

Configure your `default_bus_layout.tres` with the following clean routing structure:

```mermaid
graph TD
    Master["Master Bus (0 dB)"]
    
    Music["Music Bus (-6 dB)"] --> Master
    SFX["SFX Bus (0 dB)"] --> Master
    UI["UI Bus (0 dB)"] --> Master
    Voice["Voice / Dialogue Bus (+2 dB)"] --> Master
    
    Ducking["Ducking Sidechain\n(Compressor on Music Bus)"] -. Sidechain .-> Voice
```

